le":"After the Wedding","overview":"A manager of an orphanage in India is sent to Copenhagen, Denmark, where he discovers a life-altering family secret."},{"language":"da-DA","overview":"Jacob Petersen har viet sit liv til at hjælpe gadebørn i Indien. Børnehjemmet er lukningstruet, men den frustrerede Jacob får et usædvanligt tilbud. Forretningsmanden Jørgen, tilbyder ham en donation på 4 millioner $, men på visse betingelser. Jacob skal komme til Danmark, og han skal deltage i Jørgens datters bryllup. Brylluppet bliver et skelsættende møde mellem fortid og fremtid og sætter Jacob i sit livs dilemma."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6OFiXEHWwTrw4P8LrRRC9E2IPAL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6OFiXEHWwTrw4P8LrRRC9E2IPAL.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k4rcm9PbpaFpYgPR3vJAVNuec11.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k4rcm9PbpaFpYgPR3vJAVNuec11.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k0WGmnhE83BZDsjphV9glCCxiow.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k0WGmnhE83BZDsjphV9glCCxiow.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29t5x0Aj4cQJJC9jNR3VWS7l3JL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/29t5x0Aj4cQJJC9jNR3VWS7l3JL.jpg","language":"en","width":566,"height":849},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/czuGDkdyI6KIXoAE9uTcNTjIWMv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/czuGDkdyI6KIXoAE9uTcNTjIWMv.jpg","language":"en","width":1077,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w5Oe1y1ffFVyNv2Oa9vi7V2WeAT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w5Oe1y1ffFVyNv2Oa9vi7V2WeAT.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNILFj